
{
  "type": "minecraft:notice",
  "title": "How Commands Work",
  "external_title": "How Commands Work",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "How Commands Work",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "dark_green"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Why /trigger?",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Pandamium is a vanilla Minecraft server, so we cannot add normal custom commands.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Instead, the server uses Minecraft's ",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "trigger",
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": " system to provide custom commands through the datapack.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Basic Commands",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "gold"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "/trigger <trigger>",
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "This is used for triggers that do not require a value. For example:",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "/trigger homes",
          "color": "white"
        },
        "\n",
        {
          "text": "Lists your homes.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "/trigger vote",
          "color": "white"
        },
        "\n",
        {
          "text": "Provides the voting links.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Commands With Values",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "gold"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "/trigger <trigger> set <value>",
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Some triggers use a number to tell the datapack what action you want to perform.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "For example:",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "/trigger tpa set <id>",
          "color": "white"
        },
        "\n",
        {
          "text": "Sends a teleport request to the specified player ID.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "/trigger sethome set <home>",
          "color": "white"
        },
        "\n",
        {
          "text": "Creates or replaces the specified home.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Important",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "gold"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not every trigger accepts a value, and the available values depend on the trigger.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "You can see what each individual command does in the ",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "Commands",
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": " section of the Help Menu.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    }
  ],
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "pause": false,
  "after_action": "none",
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "translate": "gui.back"
    },
    "action": {
      "type": "minecraft:run_command",
      "command": "trigger help set 5"
    }
  }
}